{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>將軍澳發生持刀傷人案。昨晚（21日）11時許，一名年約30歲男子負傷自行前往將軍澳醫院，醫生發現其頭部和手部均有刀傷，於是通知警方。警方經調查後，初步相信事主在駿日街一間航空發動機維修服務公司對開遇襲，正調查案件。</p><p>就現場所見，上址環境僻靜，人煙極為稀少。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場環境僻靜，少人經過。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189826498538901504014853.jpeg/mwl_JSdcMWcCuR6cIJy7yGxKGo5kXAf2jXBLS7dwS0s\"/><figcaption>現場環境僻靜，少人經過。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場環境僻靜，少人經過。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261022/1189826494969417728392178.jpeg/DX81pncKv5LnNMPbVk-Rr7M3zqF0tI654TecZNs3nGQ\"/><figcaption>現場環境僻靜，少人經過。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T22:41:35.257585+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T22:35:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T22:37:39.087176+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:37:39.087176+00:00","content_hash":"bf6002b85bc6430bc4129fc5b16882bde057164982bf23fadc4aca6584b1d26c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}